<stringmatch name="mba solve #1: off keeps (x ^ c) + 2*(x &amp; c)" min="1" max="1">return \(x \^ 0x3039\) \+ \(x &amp; 0x3039\) \* 2;</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="mba solve #2: off keeps the product of constant masks" min="1" max="1">\(~x &amp; 0x4d\) \* \(x &amp; 0xffffffb2\)</stringmatch>
